SSH BRIDGE — HOW TO CALL (ALWAYS USE THIS EXACT PATTERN)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

BASE URL: https://cranial-ninth-clerical.ngrok-free.dev

ALWAYS use this exact helper setup at the top of every code block.
